Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:07.400
Seventh Day Adventism, is this a cult or a true&nbsp;
Christian church? I'm going to answer that in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.080
a moment. You're going to hear about their&nbsp;
history. You're going to also learn about what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:17.040
they believe. Some of the beliefs that are very&nbsp;
consistent with Orthodox Christian Evangelical&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:24.280
beliefs as well as some beliefs that are very&nbsp;
sketch. Now the seventh day Adventists are known&nbsp;&nbsp;

